			"lenAuto": false,
			"_k": 0,
			"desc": "Submersible well pump, 7.5 L/s at 84 m, about 11 kW. Runs when TANK-1 falls below 4.8 m and stops above 5.8 m. The 4.2 m of tank below 4.8 m holds about 185 cubic meters and the pump adds about 54 cubic meters in two hours, over the 230 cubic meters that 32 L/s needs for two hours.",
